# Team questions

Read `engine/weekly/RESEARCH.md` for the decision workflow and
`docs/TEAM-QUESTIONS.md` for the source map and cache policy. The ff-weekly tools
`weekly_checklist()` and `research_sources()` return those same files.

Establish the decision season/week once, separate it from observed usage weeks,
and pass it explicitly. Use existing read tools and their dated caches before
assembling new scripts. A prior-week status or a newly retrieved old report is
not current availability. Refresh the particular source when needed, then answer.
